# Greymoor arena playback must be deterministic off a savestate. Loads the checked-in Greymoor_03 fixture, asserts the
# hero was restored to idle (not a transient), then walks into the arena and plays the battle. The BattleScene state
# machine is not part of the snapshot (it re-initialises from the fresh scene load), so the run also anchors the battle
# progression: currentEnemies is 0 before the wave triggers and 2 once it has, and the final hero x-position pins the
# whole combat trajectory. All values are reproducible within a session (fixed clock + restored RNG); a divergence here
# is a real determinism regression.
LoadSavestate, {tests}/savestates/greymoor_03.json
   1

Assert, Equal, idle, {HeroController.hero_state}
   4,L,X
  30
  57,L,X
Assert, Equal, 0, {BattleScene.currentEnemies}
  19,L,X
   1,L,X,A
  28,L,X
  60
Assert, Equal, 2, {BattleScene.currentEnemies}
  70
  17
   1,R,A
  10
   1,R,J
  10,R,X
   2,R,A
  10
Assert, Equal, 11.98864, {HeroController.transform.position.x}
   1
***
